<title>MEXICO: Mexico stocks extend slide to close sharply down.</title>
<headline>Mexico stocks extend slide to close sharply down.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican stocks closed sharply lower on Wednesday due to fallout from a similar slide in the Dow Jones and higher U.S. bond yields.</p>
<p>Preliminary closing figures placed the blue chip IPC index off  .MXX 65.31 points, or 1.98 percent, at 3,241.75.</p>
<p>-- Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9562</p>
</text>
